** PrintTrek corner plate - out-of-plane prying bound (aluminum 6082-T6)
** 200x200x10 plate, clamped strip x<=50 (over the tube face),
** 2500 N transverse at the free edge -> M = 2500 N x 0.150 m = 375 Nm
** Hand calc: W = 200*10^2/6 = 3333 mm3 -> ~113 MPa vs yield 260 -> SF ~2.3
** Conservative: one plate takes the whole couple; really the top+bottom
** sandwich pair shares it.
** Units: mm, N, MPa
